  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementary Support (Technical Assistance) to the Solomon Islands Ministry of Finance and Treasury and the Ministry of National Planning and Development Coordination on EU-Solomon Islands Partnership for Resilience Building contract</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The European Union aims at providing Complementary Support (Technical Assistance) to the Solomon Islands Ministry of Finance and Treasury and the Ministry of National Planning and Development Coordination on EU-Solomon Islands Partnership for Resilience Building contracts&#xbf; requirements, PFM-reforms, Joint Policy Reform Group (JPRG) targets and National Development Strategy (NDS) 2016-2035 goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
